er Corp. rose 5.2% to end at $15.32 on stronger copper prices. \par \par \uc2  Telefonica SA rose 3.0% to end at $30.80, following the direction of its New York-traded ADR. \par \par \uc2  -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030407dz470099e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
