public offer for outstanding voting "A" shares of Backus. \par \par \uc2  Investment shares were created in the 1970s when various companies were obliged to issue the nonvoting shares to their workers. \par \par \uc2  Telefonica SA's rose 1.2% to end at $28.34, following gains in the share price elsewhere. \par \par \uc2  Precious metals miner Buenaventura SAA, going the other way, shed 1.8% to end at PEN43.00 on weaker gold prices. \par \par \uc2  -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030401dz4100a6y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
