\par\par \b \uc2  Peru's Stock Market, Sol Close Weaker \b0\par\par\uc2 334 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 23:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- Lima's stock indexes closed weaker Wednesday as precious metal producer Compania de Minas Buenaventura and brewer Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus & Johnston or Backus fell. \par \par \uc2  Lima's broad General Index closed 11.71 points, or 0.77%, lower at 1503.62. \par \par \uc2  The blue-chip Selective Index closed 18.24 points, or 0.78%, weaker at 2319.48. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura "C" fell 0.72% to close at 41.2 soles ($1=PEN3.4808), following a drop in international gold prices. \par \par \uc2  Backus investment shares closed down 1.52% at PEN1.30. \par \par \uc2  Investment shares were created in the 1970s, when various companies were obliged to issue the nonvoting shares to their workers. \par \par \uc2  Peruvian cement producer Cementos Pacasmayo shares rose in active trading. \par \par \uc2  Cementos Pacasmayo's common shares increased 1.27% to end at PEN1.59 while Cementos Pacasmayo's investment shares closed up 1.36% at PEN1.49. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, Peru's bank Banco de Credito recommended that investors maintain Cementos Pacasmayo's common shares and buy Cementos Pacasmayo's investment shares. \par \par \uc2  Cementos Pacasmayo recently made a bid to purchase 100% of Canada's Zemex Corp (ZMX) shares for $8.80 per share, or roughly $100 million. The deal is expected to be closed by late May. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol ended slightly weaker Wednesday after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought $2.5 million, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased $110.2 million so far this year. \par \par \uc2  The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4808 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4805-PEN3.4810 to the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The sol had closed the day before at a midrate of PEN3.4800 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.4795-PEN3.4805 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.82% on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030312dz3c00cnl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
