\par\par \b \uc2  Peru's Stock Market Falls; Sol Closed Stronger \b0\par\par\uc2 392 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 23:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- Lima's stock indexes closed weaker Tuesday as precious metal producer Compania de Minas Buenaventura and other blue chips decreased. \par \par \uc2  Lima's broad General Index closed 5.27 points, or 0.35%, lower at 1515.33. \par \par \uc2  The blue chip Selective Index closed 8.82 points, or 0.38%, weaker at 2337.72. \par \par \uc2  Buenaventura "C" fell 1.89% to close at 41.5 soles ($1=PEN3.4800), reflecting the fall of international gold prices. \par \par \uc2  Peruvian cement producer Cementos Pacasmayo shares were traded actively. \par \par \uc2  Cementos Pacasmayo's common shares fell 1.87% to end at PEN1.57 while Cementos Pacasmayo's investment shares closed unchanged at PEN1.47. \par \par \uc2  Investment shares were created in the 1970s, when various companies were obliged to issue the nonvoting shares to their workers. \par \par \uc2  On Tuesday, Peru's bank, Banco de Credito, recommended that investors maintain Cementos Pacasmayo's common shares and buy Cementos Pacasmayo's investment shares. \par \par \uc2  Cementos Pacasmayo recently made a bid to purchase 100% of Canada's Zemex Corp. (ZMX) shares for $8.80 per share, or roughly $100 million. The deal is expected to be closed by late May. \par \par \uc2  Other shares posted gains, such as Spain's Telefonica, which increased 3.01% to end at $26.69. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol ended stronger Tuesday despite a new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which bought $3.5 million, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has purchased $107.7 million so far this year. \par \par \uc2  The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4800 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4795-PEN3.4805 per dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The sol had closed the day before at a midrate of PEN3.4824 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4823-PEN3.4825 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed a total PEN100 million in certificates of deposit; it sold PEN50 million in nine-month certificates at an average rate of 4.31% and it placed another PEN50 million in six-week certificates at 4.10%. \par \par \uc2  Separately, PEN45 million in certificates of deposit matured and another PEN15 million in indexed certificates of deposit matured also on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.76% on Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030311dz3b00ci1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
