\par\par \b \uc2  Peru's Sol Closes Weaker; Stock Market Ends Stronger \b0\par\par\uc2 352 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2003\par 23:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2003, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- Lima's stock indexes closed stronger Thursday as some shares such as beer maker Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus & Johnston SAA, or Backus posted gains. \par \par \uc2  Lima's broad General Index closed 2.53 points, or 0.16%, higher at 1544.86. \par \par \uc2  The blue chip Selective Index closed 0.58 points, or 0.02%, stronger at 2393.39. \par \par \uc2  Backus' "I" share increased 3.03% to end at 1.36 soles ($1=PEN3.4795). \par \par \uc2  Colombia's Bavaria SA has said it will launch a public offer by March 20 for outstanding voting "A" shares of beverage company Backus. Investment shares were created in the 1970s, when various companies were obliged to issue the nonvoting shares to their workers. \par \par \uc2  Southern Peru Copper Corp rose 0.51% at $15.88. \par \par \uc2  But other shares decreased. \par \par \uc2  Precious metal maker Compania de Minas Buenaventura "C", the most traded share, fell slightly 0.02% to close at PEN44.70. \par \par \uc2  Compania de Minas Buenaventura SAA (BVN) on Thursday reported net income of PEN388.5 million in 2002, a 79% rise compared with PEN217.2 million in the year earlier. \par \par \uc2  Financial holding company Credicorp also closed down 0.87% to end at $10.31. \par \par \uc2  Spain's Telefonica also dropped 1.9% to $27.26. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol ended weaker Thursday after a new \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $15.8 million, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought $104.2 million so far this year. \par \par \uc2  The sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4795 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4790-PEN3.4800 per dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The sol had closed the day before at a midrate of PEN3.4783 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4780-PEN3.4785 per dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN80 million in nine-month certificates of deposit, at an average rate of 4.14% \par \par \uc2  The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.89% on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  -Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030306dz3600ct5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
