 average rate of 6.30%, another PEN50 million in 18-month certificates at an average rate of 5.05% and other PEN50 million in one-year certificates at an average rate of 4.50%. \par \par \uc2  Separately, a total of PEN102.8 million in indexed certificates of deposit also matured on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The key average overnight lending rate in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was 3.91% on Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020030304dz3400dfd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
