\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Peru \highlight\uc2 's Sol Ends Stronger Despite Ctrl Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 April 2002\par 21:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2002, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  LIMA -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's sol ended stronger in high-volume trading Tuesday despite Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy $7.5 million, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The nuevo sol closed at a midrate of PEN3.4327 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4320-PEN3.4333 per dollar, local traders said. \par \par \uc2  The sol had closed the day before at a midrate of PEN3.4355 per dollar on a spread of PEN3.4350-PEN3.4360 per dollar, local traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The sol strengthened as there was a high supply of dollars by companies that face their end-of-the-month payments in soles," a trader at Banco Wiese Sudameris said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed Wednesday due to the labor day holiday. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also placed PEN30 million in overnight repurchase agreements or repos at an average rate of 2.73%. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought $90 million so far this year in a series of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  aimed at keeping the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from appreciating too rapidly. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As of April 29, the key average overnight lending rate in the local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was 2.60%.\par    -Virginia Rey-Sanchez, Dow Jones Newswires; 511-221-7050;\par peru@dowjones.com\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1071 1837 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020020430dy4u00bq9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
